<title>UK: TABLE TENNIS-CHINA WIN MEN'S TEAM FINAL AT WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-CHINA WIN MEN'S TEAM FINAL AT WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>China won the men's team event at the world table tennis championships on Wednesday when they beat France 3-1.</p>
</text>
